    "## 1. Data understanding and quality assessment\n",
    "\n",
    "The input is at **menu-item level**. Restaurant-level metrics (ratings, channel votes, total votes, assortment breadth) are repeated over the menu rows. Restaurant counts and restaurant-level demand must therefore be deduplicated before comparing markets. Prices remain item-level.\n"
   ]
