   "source": [
    "### Data-quality flags to discuss in the report\n",
    "\n",
    "- `Is_Bestseller` is constant in the supplied file (all values are 1), so it cannot identify bestsellers. Use the text field `Best_Seller` instead.\n",
    "- Four low-count city labels are below the 20-restaurant macro-market threshold; treat macro-city comparisons as a filtered subset and report the threshold.\n",
    "- Three restaurant keys have small differences in repeated profile fields. Use median aggregation to reduce the impact of inconsistent repeated values.\n",
    "- The data dictionary does not include a timestamp/date column; temporal analysis cannot be performed without additional data.\n"
   ]
  },
