   "source": [
    "## 5. Geographical analysis – city and neighbourhood\n",
    "\n",
    "Compare only cities with at least 20 unique restaurants to avoid ranking locations from one or two outlets. The threshold is a practical filter, not a universal statistical rule.\n"
   ]
  },
