    "## 7. Temporal analysis – applicability check\n",
    "\n",
    "The supplied dataset has no date, month, year, opening date, order date or review timestamp. Therefore, a time-series trend, seasonality analysis or year-over-year comparison cannot be performed honestly. Add a timestamped source (for example, historical review/order snapshots) before attempting temporal analysis.\n"
   ]
